Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool2","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter (dba) on the most stable pool1 to see if it beats the current best single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple best_single FT_rf on the larger pool3 to see if expanding the pool improves the single-model performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool3","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test the best single FT_rf but restricted to the most stable pool1 to see if restricting improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool1","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over pool2 to see if a different deterministic method beats best_single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the larger pool3 to see if it improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on the moderately sized pool2 to see if trimming improves robustness over the full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool2","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test best_single FT_rf using pool2 to see if a different pool improves over the current best single FT_rf overall.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool2","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the larger pool3 to see if adaptive weighting beats the best single FT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["rf","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","DWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a plain mean over the full pool4 to see if a larger pool improves performance over best_single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the larger pool4 to see if it beats the current best single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the larger pool4 to see if trimming improves robustness over the weighted inverse_error.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

